"about": {"track":"Trebević, Bosna in Hercegovina (id trebevic): the narrow asphalt road from Dolovi at the edge of Sarajevo up Trebević past the viewpoint Vidikovac, the old bobsleigh track and the medieval fort Draguljac, to the junction with the road round Trebević, point to point (docs/proge-po-drzavah.md, Bosna in Hercegovina: Trebević)","frame":"metres; origin = the start line (lat0, lon0: the first point of the route); x east, z south; x = (lon - lon0) * N cos(lat0), z = -(lat - lat0) * M (WGS84 radii at lat0)","line":"the centre line every 5.002 m from the start line to the end of the road (open): OSM's polyline every 1 m, a Gaussian of sigma 3 m (the corners rounded), resampled","h":"the road's height at each point of line (m above sea level, 0.1 m): the ground model across the road (median of 5 samples, -8..8 m), the bridges straight from bank to bank, dips under 60 m filled, a 35 m median, sigma 15 m, grades at most 12 %, sigma 5 m","hRaw":"the ground model under each point of line before the smoothing (m, 0.1 m)","ways":"[s0, s1, road name (geographic names only), OSM highway, lanes, width, oneway today, surface, maxspeed, bridge]: the route's OSM ways in driving order (s in m from the start line)","bends":"[s of the apex, radius m, side (1 right, -1 left), turn deg]: the bends of line with a radius under 60 m","bld":"[x, z, length, width, angle (rad, the long side from +x towards +z), height (m, 0 = not in OSM), kind, s, d (m, + right of the travel direction)]: the buildings with any part within 60 m (OSM); kinds: 0 house / unknown, 1 church / chapel, 2 tower, 3 castle, 4 shed / garage / kiosk, 5 commercial / hotel / industrial, 6 public / station / school, 7 greenhouse, 8 ruin, 9 block of flats","bldOutline":"[index in bld, [x, z, ...]]: the outline of the buildings that are not a rectangle","trees":"[x, z, kind]: single trees (OSM) within 60 m; kind p pine, c cypress, o olive, m palm, b broadleaved, '' unknown","treeRows":"[kind, [x, z, ...]]","walls":"[barrier (OSM: wall, retaining_wall, fence, guard_rail, hedge ...), height (0 = untagged), wall / material, [x, z, ...]]: within 30 m","coast":"[x, z, ...]: the coastline within 400 m (OSM: the land on the left of the way's direction, the sea on the right)","cliffs":"[x, z, ...]: cliffs within 300 m (OSM: the lower side on the right)","lakes":"[water (OSM water=: lake, river, pond ...), name (geographic), closed (0: a ring cut off where the data ends), [x, z, ...]]: lakes and rivers as areas within 100 m","shore":"[natural (beach, bare_rock ...), [x, z, ...] outline]: within 300 m","water":"[waterway, name (geographic), culvert / tunnel, [x, z, ...]]: streams within 100 m","rail":"[railway (rail, funicular ...), bridge, tunnel, [x, z, ...]]: within 200 m","roads":"[highway, lanes, width, 1 bridge / 2 tunnel, layer, surface, name (geographic), par (1: a carriageway alongside the route), [x, z, ...]]: other roads and paths within 60 m (clipped to 80 m)","side":"[s, side (1 right, -1 left), angle (deg from the travel direction, + right), highway, lanes or width, oneway, name (geographic), [x, z, ...] the first 60 m from the junction]: every road and path that meets the route","onRoad":"[s, kind (crossing, traffic_signals, stop, give_way, calming), detail]","lamps":"[x, z]: street lamps within 30 m","stops":"[s, side, distance, shelter]: bus stops within 30 m","bridges":"[s0, s1]: the route on a bridge","over":"[s, rail / road, kind]: a railway or road on a bridge over the route","landmarks":"[label (game, Slovenian), English, kind, s, d, [x, z, ...] outline]: s and d of its nearest point","places":"[label, x, z, s, d of OSM's place from the road]: the HUD's places","grids":"PNG files next to this one (see each entry)","sources":"© OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL 1.0; the derived data here under the ODbL 1.0), downloaded 2026-11-26; Copernicus DEM GLO-30 (produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided